    {
      "id": "184:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43049:43051"
    },
    {
      "id": "184:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你探身去开床头灯。毫无反应。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43051:43067"
    },
    {
      "id": "184:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你下了床，用手电筒照着找到电灯开关。还是毫无反应。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43067:43094"
    },
    {
      "id": "184:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你走进浴室，又按了按开关。依然毫无反应。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43094:43116"
    },
    {
      "id": "184:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "毫无反应。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43116:43123"
    },
    {
      "id": "184:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "只有那台电视调到了磁带机的输入，没有画面的屏幕发散着暗淡的光。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43123:43156"
    },
    {
      "id": "184:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要检查电视，转到 186。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43156:43171"
    }
  ]
}
